# Keep LF endings everywhere, including on Windows.
#
# WezTerm clones plugins into its own cache and Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every line on checkout. The working tree
# then differs from HEAD in its entirety, and `wezterm.plugin.update_all()`
# refuses to fast-forward over "local changes" that the user never made.
* -text
